# The sim image only consumes the Pixi manifests, Python workspace, deploy
# configuration/runtime files, and helper scripts. Keep host environments and
# unrelated frontend sources out of the Windows-to-Linux BuildKit context.
**
!pixi.toml
!pixi.lock
!packages/
!packages/**
!deploy/
!deploy/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**

# Host-only or generated files inside the allowed trees.
packages/hal/aubo_i10/vendor/
deploy/bridge/
deploy/logs/
deploy/out/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.pyc
